{"data":{"body":"**P2:** For a directly visible provider whose `DurableSampler` comes from the agent class loader, this selects the system-property carrier. That carrier serializes only `SamplingDecision`, so the already-resolved custom `SamplingResult` loses sampler-added attributes and updated trace state on `DurableExecutionRoot`. Defer resolution to the foreign `DurableSampler` so it evaluates its delegate itself, or bridge the full result across loaders; add a direct-foreign test with custom attributes and trace state.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77RxaJ","finding_digest":"e0cdf981d1d13336bdc19f08823ccb4c3eab00f17d4c51a50b201665365116b3","finding_id":"arf_v1_4dg7taor2eztnpobt4eiepgljq","finding_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::foreign-sampler-result-fidelity","identity_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/otelpluginsupport.java::exportexecutionroot::foreign-sampler-result-fidelity","line":46,"observation_digest":"c2e40aa6dd8c7e9e210e36e5957f542e78c4bb62505fa0bfa2a1f9f272514e72","observation_id":"aro_v1_ylsavjw5rr7j4iiog3szk72ufz","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/OtelPluginSupport.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T06:41:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_xkdcnvmflg22sie7xby6vyfqan","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"9760d9b5666794256da34e4b8a1b523b84a71571","reviewer":"codex","start_line":46,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_723flep356dfxlzh2bdxn2ia4n","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T06:41:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
